# Convex bindings.
#
# `src/convex/_generated` is normally ignored, but a static host cannot rebuild
# it: the Convex CLI needs deploy credentials or a running `npx convex dev`, and
# the app needs the files for both `tsc -b` (`src/convex/**` imports
# `./_generated/server`) and the browser bundle (17 components import
# `@/convex/_generated/api`). It is therefore tracked.
#
# A byte-for-byte copy of the same output is also kept at
# `src/deploy/convex-bindings/`, and `src/deploy/restore-convex-bindings.mjs`
# restores it on `postinstall` and before `tsc -b` if the folder is ever absent.
# Refresh both after adding or removing a Convex function:
#   bun run convex:bindings:snapshot
#
# Deliberately NOT listed below — re-adding an ignore rule for it is what broke
# the Vercel build before: gitignore does not untrack the files, but a checkout
# that lacks them can no longer rebuild them.
#
# src/convex/_generated

.env.local
node_modules
dist
